@startuml Facet Hover Preview
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor User
participant "PlotsView" as Plots
participant "useFacets\nhooks" as Hooks
participant "API Server" as API
database "DuckDB\nMatview" as DB

User -> Plots: mouse near chart
Plots -> Hooks: prefetch(targetField)
Hooks -> API: POST /catalog-records/facets-preview\n{filters, target_field}

loop for each distinct value of target_field
    API -> DB: compute full facets\nwith value as additional filter
    DB --> API: facet counts
end

API --> Hooks: FacetsPreviewResponse\n(all value→facets mappings)
note right: cached 30s client-side

...

User -> Plots: hover specific value
Plots -> Hooks: usePreviewForValue(field, value)
Hooks -> Hooks: find cached preview entry\nfor hovered value
Hooks --> Plots: preview facets

Plots -> Plots: render semi-transparent\nshadow bars/segments\non all OTHER charts
@enduml
